{
  "version": 1,
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "flow-note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "### A widget-to-widget dataflow chain (ISSUE-51)\n\nOne widget's **output** feeds the next — select a source in each card's ⚙ panel (or reference **widget outputs** with the `{{widget:...}}` syntax in any config field).\n\nChain: **🧾 Text List → 🔎 Filter Lines → 🔢 Line Count → 🖨️ Value Display**\n\nEdit the List's text, the Filter's pattern, or the Count's label — the value propagates downstream live. The 📋 **Article List** at the bottom reads its titles straight from the Text List via `\"articles\": \"{{widget:flow-list}}\"` — watch it re-fetch when you change the list.",
        "allowExternalImages": false,
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-list",
      "widgetType": "listSource",
      "config": {
        "title": "Wikipedians",
        "items": "Ada Lovelace\nAlbert Einstein\nAlan Turing\nGrace Hopper\nLinus Torvalds",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-filter",
      "widgetType": "filterLines",
      "config": {
        "source": "flow-list",
        "title": "Matches 'a'",
        "pattern": "a",
        "match": "contains",
        "caseSensitive": false,
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-count",
      "widgetType": "lineCount",
      "config": {
        "source": "flow-filter",
        "label": "articles matching",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-echo",
      "widgetType": "echo",
      "config": {
        "source": "flow-count",
        "title": "Counted value",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-articles",
      "widgetType": "articleList",
      "config": {
        "articles": "{{widget:flow-list}}",
        "project": "en.wikipedia",
        "enrich": true,
        "maxItems": 0,
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    }
  ],
  "layout": [
    {
      "i": "flow-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 12,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 2
    },
    {
      "i": "flow-list",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4,
      "w": 3,
      "h": 5,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "flow-filter",
      "x": 3,
      "y": 4,
      "w": 3,
      "h": 5,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "flow-count",
      "x": 6,
      "y": 4,
      "w": 3,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "flow-echo",
      "x": 9,
      "y": 4,
      "w": 3,
      "h": 4,
      "minW": 2,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "flow-articles",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9,
      "w": 12,
      "h": 5,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    }
  ]
}